Plot order with two SP ports, forward
* Provenance: original R22f black-box regression deck. Two ports because 44.2 rejects SP with one; no .sens, which aborts once port nodes exist. No .pz: 44.2 keeps ac sources open after pole-zero, which corrupts later analyses.
Vdrive in 0 dc 0.4 ac 1 distof1 1m portnum=1 z0=50 sin(0.4 0.2 1k)
Rdrive in sense 1k
Rfeed sense out 1k
Clead sense out 10n
Rload out 0 2k
Ddet out 0 dj
Vport2 port 0 dc 0 ac 0 portnum=2 z0=50
Rport port out 100
.model dj d(is=1e-14)
.tran 10u 4m
.sp lin 3 1k 2k
.tf v(out) Vdrive
.op
.disto lin 3 1k 2k
.dc Vdrive 0.3 0.5 0.1
.ac lin 2 700 2.6k
.end
